WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.752
At the end of the Sui dynasty, the young Li Mi came to the Wagang stronghold and joined the Wagang Army.

00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:15.494
He crossed mountains and ridges on his way, and at last arrived before the stronghold gate.

00:00:15.844 --> 00:00:24.028
Resourceful and wise, he won people's hearts and soon became an important leader of the Wagang Army.

00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:27.666
The soldiers all admired him and were willing to follow his plans.

00:00:28.016 --> 00:00:33.800
Under his leadership, the Wagang Army grew mighty and became famous throughout the land.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.878
People from nearby came one after another to join, and the ranks grew larger and larger.

00:00:39.228 --> 00:00:45.924
Li Mi led his army in battle against the Sui forces and won brilliant victories.

00:00:46.274 --> 00:00:50.138
Every time the army marched out, he rode at the very front of the ranks.

00:00:50.488 --> 00:00:55.744
In the chaos at the end of Sui, Li Mi was a figure of great importance.

00:00:56.094 --> 00:01:01.830
But the good times did not last, and the Wagang Army's strength gradually declined.

